  {
   "id": "yukon-env-s113",
   "number": "113",
   "text": "Every person who releases a contaminant in an amount, concentration, or level in excess of that prescribed by regulation or allowed under a permit shall, as soon as possible under the circumstances, report the release to an environmental protection officer or to a person designated by regulation.",
